+brief check                 1   250000          400000               0     2500000    50000        4.50
+reviewer                    1   500000         1000000               0    10000000   250000       14.00
+reviewer over a round       1   100000               0          500000     5000000   100000        4.20
+grill lookup                1   125000               0          125000     1000000    25000        2.20
